{
  "_comment": [
    "Authoritative inventory of every deployable surface: worker routes, Stripe",
    "webhook event types, and rendered front-end pages.",
    "",
    "This file is the definition of '100% coverage'. The runner (run.mjs) fails",
    "if any id here is not asserted by a suite, and fails if a suite reports an",
    "id absent from here. drift-check.mjs independently re-derives routes and",
    "webhook cases from the Worker sources and fails if they disagree with this",
    "file \u2014 so adding a route or event without adding a test breaks the gate.",
    "",
    "Adding an entry here without a matching assertion FAILS. That is the point."
  ],
