        "Sign in to your portal",
        "Send sign-in code"
      ],
      "why": "the unauthenticated sign-in entry point \u2014 the whole customer funnel starts here"
    }
  ],
  "invariants": [
    {
      "id": "inv.no-stripe-api-base-in-deployed-config",
      "why": "STRIPE_API_BASE is a test-only seam. If it ever appears in a wrangler.toml or deploy workflow it would redirect live payment traffic."
    },
    {
      "id": "inv.no-secrets-in-repo",
      "why": "Stripe/SES/session secrets must only ever arrive via `wrangler secret put`, never committed."
    },
    {
      "id": "inv.deploy-workflows-gated",
      "why": "Every deploy workflow must depend on the quality gate. This invariant is what stops the gate being quietly bypassed."
    },
    {
      "id": "inv.release-gated-on-cli-tests",
      "why": "This gate covers the Workers and front ends, not the CLI/lib/checks that release.yml actually ships. Without a separate dependency on test.yml a release is gated only on code it does not ship."
    }
  ],
  "artefacts": [
    {
      "id": "flow.customer-signin",
      "why": "the customer funnel end to end in a browser against real Workers; render tests alone cannot prove sign-in works"
    },
    {
      "id": "cli.help",
      "why": "the CLI must start and advertise its interface"
    },
    {
      "id": "cli.lib-tests",
      "why": "the existing lib/ test harness, now inside the gate"
    },
    {
      "id": "cli.check-metadata",
      "why": "malformed metadata breaks --framework/--category filtering, which compliance customers buy"
    },
    {
      "id": "cli.corpus",
      "why": "the check corpus must be present, substantial and syntactically valid"
    },
    {
      "id": "cli.detects-bad",
      "why": "a scanner that never reports anything passes every other check"
    },
    {
      "id": "cli.clean-good",
      "why": "detection must not fire indiscriminately on clean input"
    },
    {
      "id": "cli.self-scan",
      "why": "the free-tier airgapped path users actually run"
    },
    {
      "id": "cli.framework-filter",
      "why": "--framework selection underpins the compliance offering"
    },
    {
      "id": "pkg.action",
      "why": "action.yml is first contact for GitHub Actions users"
    },
    {
      "id": "pkg.install",
      "why": "install.sh is piped straight into bash from get.preston-check.com"
    },
    {
      "id": "pkg.docker",
      "why": "the published image and its entrypoint"
    },
    {
      "id": "pkg.ai-addon",
      "why": "the paid AI add-on's shell and JSON assets"
    }
  ]
}
